Z||000007||Urchin||06-17-2001||05:11 PM||||Darklord is right about the "limited edition" sticker.  That's my beast of burden.  The only thing "limited" on that car are the options.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> By the way Darklord, if you wanna go check out westmount mall on Thursday.  Take 22 highway west from masonville.  I think it's two stes of lights and turn left onto Wellington rd.  Keep following that road until you pass Commissioners rd. and its on the right hand side just after that.  Then just go to the back of the mall.  I hope that makes sense...<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature2_3.jpg">   <P>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||1
