Z||000020||Huck||06-21-2001||05:49 PM||||Hey guys... you all might think this is a bad idea, but there is a car show in Chesley (my hometown) as part of Julyfest, our annual festival and piss up  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> on sunday of the long weekend.. I guess that would be Canada day.  Anyways, its usually an excellent show, gets better every year... Its in the park in the shade, on grass, beside the river running through town.. last year there were 150 some cars (mostly classic) ... Except, there's never been a Fiero there before.  It would be a great place for us to show off, and then I wouldnt be the only fiero in the show.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>If anyone's free, or interested, let me know.  I think cars start showing up around 10:00 - 11:00am.<P>Huck<BR>87 GT T-top||||reg||1
