Z||000025||Huck||06-23-2001||12:23 PM||||Last year there were a few rods.  Really, there's a collection of everything... the majority of them are 60's muscle cars though...  there's also always some forty's and fifty's stuff too... there was a real cool old chop top mobster car there last year too..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Walkerton... heh.. I used to say that chesley was near Hanover or Owen Sound, but now if someone asks I just say 15 min north of Walkerton..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Huck||||reg||1
